  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, and cinnamon. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the apples and cook for 2-3 minutes, until slightly tender.",
    "Add the chicken broth and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and cook, covered, for 20-25 minutes, or until the apples are tender.",
    "Stir in the honey, if using.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve warm, garnished with fresh cilantro, if desired."
